# Route: guide 47 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to 60, 48
# quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Winterspring, Stranglethorn Vale, Azshara, Darkshore, Ashenvale,
# Felwood): Frostfire Hot Springs -> Lake Kel'Theril -> Everlook -> Starfall
# Village -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Everlook -> Gurubashi Arena ->
# Nesingwary's Expedition -> Booty Bay -> Southridge Beach -> Temple of
# Arkkoran -> Southridge Beach -> Grove of the Ancients -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): High Chief Winterfall (5121; High
# Chief Winterfall 59); The Final Piece (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59); The
# Name of the Beast (3510; Hetaera 55).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Drakefire Amulet (6502), Blackfathom Villainy (1200).

